1 | monuments | Alabama Monument: site, specifications and inscription approved by the acting superintendent on August 3, 1932 | - | !1932-08-03 (approval of the monument site, specifications and inscription; the monument was erected after the battle) | stated | The finding aid says the monument site, specifications and inscription for the Alabama monument were approved in the acting superintendent's letter of August 3, 1932 | The monument site, specifications and inscription for the AL monument has been approved. | 7. Acting Supt. James B. Aumen to Frank Hammaker, Aug 3, 1932

